सम्-अति-√ क्रम् P. Ā. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, to go or pass by entirely, cross or step over, MBh.;
to step out of (abl.), R.;
to transgress, neglect, disregard, lose, ib.;
to surpass, excel exceed, MBh.;
to pass away, elapse (as time), Vet.;
to let pass by or elapse (द्वौ मासौ समतिक्रम्य, ‘after the lapse of two months’), R.
